<slide>
  theme: light
</slide>

## Built-in `light`

Crisp on projectors. Per-slide, so you can mix themes inside one deck.

<code lang=python id=g1>
  <frame>
    def total(prices, tax=0.2):
        return sum(prices) * (1 + tax)
  </frame>
  <frame>
    def total(prices, tax=0.2):
        net = sum(prices)
        return round(net * (1 + tax), 2)
  </frame>
</code>
